<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian drones are now operating over Sudan while RSF drones launch from Ethiopian territory against Sudanese targets, prompting reciprocal diplomatic expulsions and consular closures. An RPG strike near a school in Moyale killed dozens of Ethiopian Orthodox believers and a Kenyan, sparking increased police deployment and security talks, and attacks on Orthodox Christians continue in Arsi, Benishangul Gumuz and the north, with blasts heard in Addis Ababa. Seed insecurity threatens Tigray farmers and a psychosocial and spiritual care pilot is being tested. The war caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOMmFoX1h5TUFBaVFMVnJ4VkpKOTA1Mzc2U3dORFdENEJ0WlIwSzdvNE1uTVNLa2REeDM2U05HZ0RNX0pLWFVJMzNzVEhBU2x1Z292TlRHWHB1SGZIWU90bjJuWG5PQ0F2dy04Qkx5SzQxaTFBbVB1emRXRVZiZEYzY3p0YXJxLXM2ekVoYjVCUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNbnktbnBwZ3VCRGJYel9YOFRTaE9FVk5NUkdENlhIY2NLWjRqa21YVHZRd01BYTRBQWt4Y0xoeDlhVU1nOHRBeXE5SjZPXzFYbVN4ZDhSQjJEem5RbFZGSDZZZEdrRC0wbEg5S3NtX2duSWxsRjdURTN5ZkVjZ3BIVFFzU2FvNi15MWxOZU4xUFE3RkhpMGZSZ3hDeV9qZkdfMmlFTmNB?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxQOEdEeXB1RDlfTW5uZ3hFM2l3TGtBVXduRHl2eWVuU3dIUzEwMlNtR0RpSVNBZUJTU1dwVkY1dF91WThIWGlra19UWHNjTHMxcDlLUWdsZ0xIb0MtdGdpSEg3U0NqTkJ1T2k1UjlPSGxESmp0MDUtUm9sa25xcmVoRDI3SUhNRU5wODk3X3pLb09PZmtVc2ZKWkZUWFRRRzFnME9sbW9nMjZMY21BNWVpOWhCMHlkdXV3Y3RVdUs1SFU?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE05VF9OLVpoS0xlV0RkVnZNU2lycWdMUEdMUGc5aDNLVWlCRTltZkhfSk5OZERzS2lGM2pqRWdPdjZpWGpzOC1LYk5GdEZaS1dyc1FYS2FjRQ?oc=5&qu